    <innerclass refid="class_parabola" prot="public">Parabola</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the <ref refid="class_parabola" kindref="compound">Parabola</ref> class representing a quadratic function y = ax^2 + bx + c. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class allows defining a parabola using its two zeros and maximum point, and provides methods to evaluate the function and access or modify its coefficients. </para>
